extends ../layout.pug

block head
	title Rules

block content
	h1.board-title Global Rules
	.table-container.flex-center.mv-10
		table.table-body
			tr.table-row
				td
					p 1. You #[b MUST] be 18 years or older to post on this website.
					p.rule-clarification Underage users will be immediately banned off the site.
					p 2. Do #[b NOT] post or request any illegal content.
					p.rule-clarification This includes any form of pedophilia, zoophilia, and zoosadism.
					p.rule-clarification This also extends to Lolicon & Shotacon.
					p 3. Do #[b NOT] post NSFW on strictly SFW boards.
					p.rule-clarification Please read the board-specific rules for more detail.
					p.rule-clarification Common sense applies, and mods may move or delete posts at their discretion.
					p 4. Attempting to get this website taken down via DDOS, false reports, or advocating for law-breaking is forbidden.
					p 5 Do #[b NOT] advertise for imageboards, Discord servers, Telegram channels, Crypto projects, etc.
					p.rule-clarification Cross-posting is generally allowed as long as it is within reason.
					p 6. You will adhere to the general topic or theme of the board you intend to post in. 
					p.rule-clarification Common sense applies, and mods may move or delete posts at their discretion.
					p 7. False or spam reports may result in a temporary ban.
					p 8. You will #[b NOT] announce your suicide. All suicide posts will result in an immediate ban.
	
	h1.board-title Board-Specific Rules
	.table-container.flex-center.mv-10
		table.table-body
			tr.table-row
				td
					h3.subboard-title /gg/ - Gay General
					hr
					p 1. This is the general topic board.
					p 2. NSFW content is permitted, but it must be tagged as "NSFW". 
					p.rule-clarification Porn threads & general horny posts will either be deleted or moved to #[b /homo/]
					br
					h3.subboard-title /homo/ - Gay Dungeon
					hr
					p 1. This is the NSFW board.
					p 2. Fetishes that break or skirt rule 2 (i.e: ageplay, age gap, age regression, etc.) are prohibited, and may result in a ban.
					p 3. Extreme NSFL fetishes such as guro is prohibited.

	h1.board-title Moderation Guidelines
	.table-container.flex-center.mv-10
		table
			tr
				td
					p #[i (Note: This is copied from the framework, and will be modified later in the future.)]
					p 1. A 10 year ban.
					p 2. A 1 hour ban or longer at staff discretion.
					p 3. A 1 day ban or longer at staff discretion.
					p 4. A 4 hour ban or longer at staff discretion.
					p 5. A 1 year ban or longer at staff discretion.
					p 6. As long as I feel like in the moment, don't test me.
					.edited
						| If you believe a ban is false, appeal it. If you feel your appeals are
						| wrongly denied reach the site Admin by email, see 
						| <a href="/faq.html">faq</a>.
						| #[b However], if your email is nonsense that is the end of it.
